The '''Garel City Spaceport''', also known as '''Garel spaceport''', was a [[spaceport]] located in [[Garel City]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] of [[Garel]]. The spaceport was used by [[Star Commuter 2000]] [[shuttle]] [[ST-45]],<ref name="Droids in Distress" /> linking Garel with the neighboring planet of [[Lothal]].<ref name="Droids Trivia">{{SW|url=series/droids-in-distress-trivia-gallery|text="Droids in Distress" Trivia Gallery}}</ref>

In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Galactic Atlas">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> the [[Spectres|crew]] of the ''[[Ghost]]'' [[Thief|stole]] [[T-7 ion disruptor rifle]]s from the [[Galactic Empire]] in the spaceport. After multiple missions on Garel, the Empire inevitably discovered the location of the rebel base in the city. A Star Destroyer preceded to shoot down multiple rebel vessels at the [[Battle of Garel]].<ref name="Droids in Distress" />

